    {
      "id": "ef6d2afd",
      "name": "Fleet Target Sweep (3 Drones) 1",
      "content": "Three-drone target sweep: Drone 2, Drone 4, and Drone 5 take off together to 19 meters altitude. Drone 2 flies to target Polygon Target 1, Drone 4 flies to target Circle Target 2, and Drone 5 flies to target Polygon Target 2. After reaching the targets, all three drones move west for 54m, then south for 78m, then north for 88m together. Each drone must complete the specified directional movements (west 54m, south 78m, north 88m) regardless of starting position - if obstacles block the path, drones should adjust position as needed to complete the full directed distance in each heading.",
      "content_aliases": [
        "Coordinate Drone 2, Drone 4, and Drone 5: ascend together to 19 meters altitude, send Drone 2 to target Polygon Target 1, Drone 4 to target Circle Target 2, and Drone 5 to target Polygon Target 2, then execute coordinated sweep movement west 54m, south 78m, and north 88m. All drones must complete the full directional distance (west 54m, south 78m, north 88m) from their respective positions, adjusting as needed to avoid obstacles.",
        "Three-drone target sweep operation: launch Drone 2, Drone 4, and Drone 5 to altitude 19m, navigate to targets Polygon Target 1, Circle Target 2, Polygon Target 2 respectively, then shift west by 54 meters, south by 78 meters, and north by 88 meters in synchronized operation. Each drone travels the specified distance in each direction regardless of obstacles encountered.",
        "Execute three-drone sweep mission: Drone 2, Drone 4, Drone 5 take off reaching 19 meters height, fly to targets Polygon Target 1, Circle Target 2, Polygon Target 2 respectively, then proceed west for 54m, subsequently south for 78m, and finally north for 88m together, with each drone completing the full directed movements by repositioning around obstacles if necessary.",
        "Three-drone coordinated target mission: Drone 2, Drone 4, and Drone 5 lift off to 19m elevation, reach targets Polygon Target 1, Circle Target 2, Polygon Target 2 respectively, then travel west 54 meters, south 78 meters, and north 88 meters in sequence. The specified directional distances must be achieved by each drone, adapting position to circumvent any obstacles."
      ],
